const R33_STYLE = `Warm nostalgic mall illustration — saturated 90s commercial art palette, fluorescent overhead lighting casting soft warm glows, terrazzo and linoleum floor reflections, department store catalog aesthetic meets Saturday morning cartoon energy`;

